<title>BELGIUM: EU raises durum wheat import duties.</title>
<headline>EU raises durum wheat import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will raise durum wheat import duties on Friday, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>Duties on transatlantic imports will be raised to 5.29 Ecus a tonne from zero Ecus while duties on nearby imports will rise to 15.29 Ecus from 8.55 Ecus.  </p>
